     6710                 accumulate f-cost-sum       (TOTAL ) .
     6711                 accumulate f-sale-sum       (TOTAL ) .
     6712                 accumulate f-sale-other     (TOTAL ) .
     6713                 accumulate f-crsa-sum       (TOTAL ) .
